Assumption: apparent elevations, reciprocal colocation; slab must span full path projection. The 10deg wet case needs a broad cell about 5.67km across for a 1km vertical slab. Conditional stress case only; no joint probability or universal worst case.
Radiative transfer: use RX T_out = T_in*transmission + T_emit on Moon/sky main-beam brightness once; ground spillover bypasses atmosphere. Keep RX atmospheric emission distinct from receiver noise. Do not transform aggregate Tsys that already includes sky/ground.
